DESCRIPTION:Conference title: IEEE Conference on Secure and Trustworthy Mac
 hine Learning\nWebsite: https://satml.org/\nSource URL: https://satml.org
 /call-for-papers/\nLocation: To be announced\nTopics: Robustness & Safety
 \, Privacy-preserving ML\, Fairness & Responsible AI\, Explainability & I
 nterpretability\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Paper-based / systematization 
 of knowledge / position papers\nConfidence: estimated\nLast checked date:
  2026-10-29\nNotes: As of 2026-10-29 satml.org covers only SaTML 2027 (Re
 ykjavik\, May 3-6\, 2027) and announces no 2028 host or dates. Main-meeti
 ng dates and the Tuesday abstract (Sep 21)/paper (Sep 28) AoE deadlines a
 re one-year same-weekday proxies from SaTML 2027\; past meetings have ran
 ged from February to May.\nScope: Security\, safety\, and trustworthiness
  of machine learning. Characteristic work studies attacks and defenses\, 
 privacy\, verification\, ML-system security\, fairness\, interpretability
 \, and trustworthy data curation. Theoretical\, empirical\, and applied p
 apers must engage substantively with a safety or trustworthiness question
 \; merely using an ML model is insufficient.\nAdditional topics: Machine 
 Learning\, ML Systems & Infrastructure\nScope sources (2027): https://sat
 ml.org/call-for-papers/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
